---
title: "5.4.4 Sequence — formulir lead sampai CRM"
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor PW as Pengunjung<br/>(website UMKM)
  participant API as API formulir<br/>(publik)
  participant DB as Postgres<br/>(leads, CRM, outbox)
  participant WK as Worker<br/>+ Resend
  actor OW as Pemilik<br/>(email, PWA, CRM)
  PW->>+API: POST kiriman + token Turnstile, request_key
  Note over API: Validasi V-13, hostname → site, cek Turnstile di server
  alt honeypot terisi
    API-->>PW: 202 umum (kiriman dibuang)
  else Turnstile gagal
    API-->>PW: 403 E-BOT-CHECK
  else lewat batas 5/IP/jam, 100/hari, atau kuota
    API-->>PW: 429 E-RATE-LIMITED
  else lolos
    API->>DB: INSERT kiriman, lead, consent, atribusi UTM, outbox
    API-->>-PW: 202 + pesan terima kasih
  end
  DB->>+WK: lead.created
  WK->>DB: Upsert kontak (email/E.164, RB-28), peluang Baru, aktivitas, tugas 1 jam
  Note over WK,DB: Idempoten per lead_id, kuota 5.000 kontak (RB-27)
  WK->>OW: Email lead, prioritas P1 (≤ 2 menit)
  WK-->>OW: Push PWA “Lead baru” tanpa data pribadi (Should)
  opt email terpental
    WK->>DB: Suppression + spanduk di dashboard
  end
  deactivate WK
  OW->>DB: Buka kontak, balas WhatsApp, pindah ke Dihubungi
